        <mxCell id="t2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#555&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to read it:&lt;/b&gt; top to bottom is the physical path into the house &amp;#8212; everything below the gateway is one flat network. Box &amp;#9316; is the only part that automates anything; everything in &amp;#9317; is reached from there. Detail lives on page 2 and in the LLD set.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
